=== Hybrid Retrieval with RRF + HuggingFace Reranking ===

This example demonstrates combining vector (semantic) and text (keyword)
retrieval using CombinedStore with Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF), with
optional reranking via a PostQueryEvent listener.

Query: "crime family mafia"

--- Vector-Only Results (semantic similarity) ---
  1. The Godfather (Score: 0.3333)
  2. Reservoir Dogs (Score: 0.5809)
  3. Kill Bill: Vol. 1 (Score: 0.6554)
  4. Gladiator (Score: 0.6772)
  5. The Matrix (Score: 0.6891)
  6. Pulp Fiction (Score: 0.6942)
  7. The Green Mile (Score: 0.7379)
  8. Memento (Score: 0.7418)
  9. The Shawshank Redemption (Score: 0.8278)
  10. Apocalypse Now (Score: 0.8399)
  11. Spirited Away (Score: 0.8409)
  12. The Dark Knight (Score: 0.8457)
  13. The Prestige (Score: 0.8626)
  14. Notting Hill (Score: 0.8677)
  15. Cloud Atlas (Score: 0.8709)
  16. WALL-E (Score: 0.8817)
  17. Inception (Score: 0.8962)
  18. Project Hail Mary (Score: 0.9084)
  19. Interstellar (Score: 0.9452)
  20. Jurassic Park (Score: 1.0000)

--- Text-Only Results (keyword matching) ---
  1. The Godfather (Score: 0.0000)
  2. Gladiator (Score: 0.0000)

--- Hybrid RRF Results (CombinedStore, no reranker) ---
  1. The Godfather (RRF Score: 0.016393)
  2. Reservoir Dogs (RRF Score: 0.016129)
  3. Kill Bill: Vol. 1 (RRF Score: 0.015873)
  4. The Matrix (RRF Score: 0.015625)
  5. Pulp Fiction (RRF Score: 0.015385)
  6. The Green Mile (RRF Score: 0.015152)
  7. Memento (RRF Score: 0.014925)
  8. The Shawshank Redemption (RRF Score: 0.014706)
  9. Apocalypse Now (RRF Score: 0.014493)
  10. Spirited Away (RRF Score: 0.014286)
  11. Gladiator (RRF Score: 0.014085)
  12. The Dark Knight (RRF Score: 0.013889)
  13. The Prestige (RRF Score: 0.013699)
  14. Notting Hill (RRF Score: 0.013514)
  15. Cloud Atlas (RRF Score: 0.013333)
  16. WALL-E (RRF Score: 0.013158)
  17. Inception (RRF Score: 0.012987)
  18. Project Hail Mary (RRF Score: 0.012821)
  19. Interstellar (RRF Score: 0.012658)
  20. Jurassic Park (RRF Score: 0.012500)

--- Hybrid RRF + HuggingFace Reranking Results ---
  1. The Godfather (Relevance: -7.4139)
  2. Pulp Fiction (Relevance: -10.1210)
  3. Reservoir Dogs (Relevance: -10.7232)
  4. Gladiator (Relevance: -11.1614)
  5. Interstellar (Relevance: -11.2017)

=== Summary ===
- Vector retrieval finds semantically similar documents via embeddings
- Text retrieval matches documents by keyword overlap
- CombinedStore merges both result lists using rank-based RRF scoring
- Adding a RerankerListener via EventDispatcher further refines results using a cross-encoder
